Z||000021||Fiero*101||11-28-2001||12:26 AM||||Ok for the one coment about Nascar is not racing.<BR>what do you mean its not racing?<BR>I want you to define Racing for me.<BR>Ok there is Indy car/Cart Racing which is around in circles. F1 racing is alot of different turns here and there. And even Nascar races on Road Courses<BR>Dont mean to be mean but I think if one person is trying to out run the other that is racing thats what Nascar drivers do every Weekend. Have you ever been to a Nascar race?<BR>I take it not b/c there alot of fun<P>Just my 2 cents<BR> but for the Dale Earnhardt post Yeah he will be missed but to be honest i didnt like him, infact i hated him. But i loved to hate him (if that makes any sence at all. And racing wont be the same w/ out him.<BR>Sorry i just had to vent abit <BR>Nascar is not all hillbillys!<BR>Tony Stewart is not a hillbilly!!!!<BR>And sad to say eather is Jeff Gordon  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>I have alot more to say but am to tired to type any more thanks for the vent time and the space  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar101.jpg"> ||||reg||1
